        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Diigheanda haw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Suh digheanyeeka gil ea deaweedajeega ea huumeanyeeka ASEETEANG'WA gil jea daanaaleagwa, ak goosisi mureeda aba ng'eanyiida jea ookeawsiina ak goombaliischeewi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda goosisi mureeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ang'iing'i ea orjeedang'u ea orjeedeaba daang'u, ak giing'oanyi deaweedajeagaaschi ghayi earukuneey aba jeeda eaweagaagu sean, ak abeeda ghwasaang'ayiit eaweagaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ooleeysiinean iit Ea Israeli ak goosisi mureeda, abeeda gajanyasa ghawooda ak gayghoahaada jeacheengeagwa, ghoah gidarukuneata NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ghweanigeagwa aba ng'eanyiida gulda eanooga ea maleeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea Israeli, aleaydiit gideaba: NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA niny NG'UTAMIIDA asagi gil, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bwariinya NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U aba gurooroadaang'u sean ea aba jeadaang'u sean ea aba uurdaang'u sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ng'asheesu earukuneey ghamneawean gajiina jeeda gurooroadaang'u ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gajanaala diibigaagu aba badiida, ak gaybalooleena nea giipteadi aba jeedeaba gheang'u ea iiwi aba naweeda ea iili ea iing'eadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak giradi ghoah giirooraneeda aba gheata geatindaang'u ak girasi weasta gheamamdaang'u ak goopkeatuneey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ging'oorsi daraneeda gidaghuuta bea gheang'u ea uhuuda beehiida gidaghuuteaba gheang'u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Reekusiinda aba nyoota mureeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abeeda iyahiitaneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ng'eanyiida neajeesa sea ghweanigeagwa was Abrahamu ea Yakobo ea Isaka, gideaba gaygagoonyi, was mujiinajeega miyaasiin hees, mideasi ang'iing'i ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gealga nyiit jeeda haleanjeeda miyaasiin nea ea miyiin ang'iing'i, nea eara healatka sing'alda, ming'aldani ang'iing'i, eara madameega sabiibu ea saytuunajeega mihistani ang'iing'i, ak gajaga ak gilang'uudi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fura geaw adiidu gwarooseey NG'UTAMIIDA, aruunaneey ng'eanyiida Misri was gheeda soomjeandumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisiina Mureeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, bwada gheawungaaschi nea gajaga habeawooda aba gheawungaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu ghoabwachi aseecheeka suuk, aseecheeka eemoojiga neaweeseegwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA mida bugusteang'wa ASEETA ng'waan jihi, adiidu gwanyareekseey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ak gaygwanyarjaneey aba badayda ng'eanyiida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adiidu goosimsimnyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA ghoah giduurji ghayi aba Masa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisiina mureeda ea badiida digheanyeeka NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA ea huumeanyeeka ea deaweedajeega ghayi rukuneey ang'iing'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sina ng'asheesu miyaasiin ea gea doabiiw aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gajanyasa giibinda miy ak gajahita ak goombaliischeewi ng'eanyiida miy aksa habeawooda NG'UTAMIIDA gideaba gayghoadaw ghweanigeagwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gaygooruuteawa madeadaang'u eemoojiga was weajoodiga ghoah gidarukuteayda NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ama anyaashnyi orjoagaagu galanya, ‘Gideabeadaanyi naaha dea huumeanyeeka ea deaweedajeega ea digheanyeeka ghayi rukuneey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gajeeshiina orjeedang'u, ‘ghayi geewooschi soomjooga Farao aba ng'eanyiida Misri, ak gooruuteaweasa NG'UTAMIIDA ng'eanyiida Misri aba geatindaanyi haw uuri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea geadaayi aba gheanyangaasa nea goohiimsa NG'UTAMIIDA ng'asheega hees hang'oonyi aba ng'eanyiida Misri ea Farao ea fuga hees gheanyi, aba madeeda gheanyangaasa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gooruuteawaneasa ak gweaneasa hiji gagooneasa ng'eanyiida aksa habeawooda ghweanigaasa gideaba gayghoadaw ng'eanyiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea NG'UTAMIIDA gwarukuneasa gideaba gajeesisiina niny mureeda ea diigheanyeekaaschi ak geawali gheang'da NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA, aba alooheedeanya galeagasean, ak goodiing'daneasa eanyasa eaweega gawuurji gideaba ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gayghoadoabiiw aba heedeanya, nea geeshageachi ak geesinyi diigheanyeeksu sean aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANyean gawuurji gidarukuteayda heedeanya.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
